                  {
                    "value": "1.  Incident data stops January 2022.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11px",
                      "color": "#013366",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "   ~2,700 incidents never reached Silver; the watermark is stuck (with Sebastian). Every window is anchored to the latest well-populated month.",
